	keywords = {Carbon capture; Cements; Environmental management; Feedstocks; Global warming; Life cycle; Municipal solid waste; Sensitivity analysis; Silicate minerals; Slags; Waste incineration; Carbon dioxide mineralization; CO2 capture and storage; CO2 capture and utilization; Comparative life cycle assessment; Life cycle assessment; Life cycle assessment analysis; Mineral carbonation; Mineralisation; Mineralization process; Negative values; Carbon dioxide},
